SUMMARY:Deadline: Fonds BJP Press Play 2027: Development Programme for Jour
 nalistic Makers
DESCRIPTION:Press Play helps makers develop and pitch a journalistic or cre
 ative project\, with five places in each of four tracks: audio\, video\, w
 riting and photo. You do not need to be a professional journalist\, but yo
 u must attend in person in the Netherlands and work in Dutch\; past Fonds 
 BJP project-subsidy recipients and books\, comics and fiction are excluded
 .\n\nOrganisation: Fonds BJP (Fonds voor Bijzondere Journalistieke Project
 en)\nLocation: Netherlands (in person\; programme in Dutch)\nAward: EUR 3\
 ,200 towards about 20 days of time invested\, plus a personal coach and wo
 rkshops. No application fee.\nDuration: March to May 2027\n\nMore: https:/
 /fondsbjp.nl/subsidies/press-play/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
URL:https://fondsbjp.nl/subsidies/press-play/?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands (in person\; programme in Dutch)
END:VEVENT
