SUMMARY:Deadline: vfonds: Onze Democratie and Onze Vrijheid project grants 
 (rolling under EUR 50\,000\; larger grants due 14 January 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Two parallel schemes for public projects about democracy\, the 
 rule of law and freedom\, and one of the few large Dutch funders where jus
 tice themes are the point of the call. ONZE DEMOCRATIE funds projects that
  draw people into democracy: its listed topics include the rule of law\, f
 undamental rights\, polarisation and discrimination.\n\nOrganisation: vfon
 ds (Nationaal Fonds voor Vrede\, Vrijheid en Veteranenzorg)\nLocation: Kin
 gdom of the Netherlands. RESTRICTED: a stichting or vereniging with its ow
 n business bank account\; the project must have regional or national reach
 .\nAward: No published maximum. Requests under EUR 50\,000 are rolling\; r
 equests of EUR 50\,000 or more go to four fixed rounds a year. vfonds cove
 rs at most 50% of project costs. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: 
 Per project\; apply at least three months before the start\n\nMore: https:
 //www.vfonds.nl/aanvraag-doen/democratie/onze-democratie?utm_source=artifi
 cialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.vfonds.nl/aanvraag-doen/democratie/onze-democratie?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Kingdom of the Netherlands. RESTRICTED: a stichting or vereniging 
 with its own business bank account\; the project must have regional or nat
 ional reach.
END:VEVENT
