SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Gemeente Den Haag: Arts and Culture Projects 20
 27\, spring windows (Category A up to EUR 10\,000\, Category B up to EUR 3
 0\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Feb 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nThe City of The Hague's pro
 ject subsidy for public-facing work in theatre\, music\, dance\, film\, li
 terature\, visual arts or any combination. WHO: professional arts organisa
 tions\, broedplaatsen and artists active in The Hague. Individuals can app
 ly only in Category A (with DigiD)\; legal entities such as a stichting\, 
 vereniging or BV need eHerkenning level EH3.\n\nOrganisation: Gemeente Den
  Haag (Haagse Kunst- en Cultuurprojecten)\nLocation: The Hague\, Netherlan
 ds. RESTRICTED: professional artists\, arts organisations and broedplaatse
 n active in The Hague.\nAward: Category A: EUR 2\,000 to EUR 10\,000\, cov
 ering at most 70% of the budget (open to individuals). Category B: EUR 10\
 ,000 to EUR 30\,000\, covering at most 30% of the budget (legal entities o
 nly). No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Public-facing projects of u
 p to one year\n\nMore: https://www.denhaag.nl/nl/subsidies/subsidie-kunst-
 en-cultuurprojecten-aanvragen/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral
URL:https://www.denhaag.nl/nl/subsidies/subsidie-kunst-en-cultuurprojecten-
 aanvragen/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:The Hague\, Netherlands. RESTRICTED: professional artists\, arts o
 rganisations and broedplaatsen active in The Hague.
END:VEVENT
