 arte Fonds and Rijksmuseum Meermanno\, House of the Book\nLocation: Rijksm
 useum Meermanno\, The Hague\, Netherlands. RESTRICTED: artists based in th
 e Netherlands.\nAward: EUR 8\,500 artist's fee plus a EUR 4\,000 productio
 n budget\, with content support during the research and artistic guidance.
  The artwork remains the artist's property. No application fee mentioned.\
 nDuration: Work period January to June 2027\; exhibition 27 June to 31 Oct
 ober 2027\n\nMore: https://www.amarte.nl/en/x-amarte/rijksmuseum-meermanno
 -x-amarte?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
