DTSTART:20270201T222900Z
DTEND:20270201T225900Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Rijksakademie Residency 2028 (Amsterdam\; EUR 2
 1\,600 stipend\; applications 1 January to 1 February 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Feb 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nThe Rijksakademie invites a
 rtists for a residency in Amsterdam from January to December 2028\, with t
 he possibility of staying a second year. About 23 artists join each year a
 nd work with a private studio\, technical workshops and specialists\, a li
 brary and visiting advisors.\n\nOrganisation: Rijksakademie van beeldende 
 kunsten\nLocation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands. Open to artists from all count
 ries and disciplines\; around half of the residents come from the Netherla
 nds.\nAward: Stipend of EUR 21\,600 per year (2027 figure)\, paid monthly\
 , plus a private studio and a work budget. FEES: non-refundable applicatio
 n fee of EUR 60 (waived for artists living in OECD DAC-list countries) and
  an annual participation fee of EUR 1\,875 for selected residents.\nDurati
 on: 12 months\, January to December 2028\, with the possibility of a secon
 d year\; about 23 artists per year.\n\nMore: https://rijksakademie.nl/en/r
